```mermaid
graph TB
    Start([Start]) --> Init["1. Initialize parameters<br/>W and b random small values"]
    Init --> Forward["2. Forward propagation<br/>Compute predictions ŷ"]
    Forward --> Cost["3. Compute cost J<br/>How wrong are predictions?"]
    Cost --> Backward["4. Backward propagation<br/>Compute gradients dW, db"]
    Backward --> Update["5. Update parameters<br/>W = W - α·dW"]
    Update --> Check{Cost low<br/>enough?}
    Check -->|No| Forward
    Check -->|Yes| End([Done!<br/>Use trained model])
    
    style Init fill:#fff3cd
    style Forward fill:#cfe2ff
    style Cost fill:#f8d7da
    style Backward fill:#d1e7dd
    style Update fill:#e2d4f3
    style End fill:#d4edda
```
